ding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/62/p5x6zgpcqribpam8lo3iuwfqrqi20pp.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%8B%82%E6%BE%9C%E4%BD%99%E6%80%92.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/62/p5x6zgpcqribpam8lo3iuwfqrqi20pp.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />狂澜余怒\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[职业技能]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（被动）以[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"武技\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">武技</font></span></span>]技能攻击后，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"溢出伤害值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">溢出伤害值</font></span></span>]转化为穿透伤害，由主目标范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格内其他敌人分摊，分摊时额外造成<font color=\"#d68fe2\">50%</font>魔法伤害（不含[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"物品\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">物品</font></span></span>]）。<br />\n✦若范围内没有敌人则储存[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"溢出伤害值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">溢出伤害值</font></span></span>]，并在下一次含[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"武技\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">武技</font></span></span>]技能攻击前，使用储存值对主目标附加1次穿透伤害（溢出或储存最大值不超过魔攻值的800%）。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%BD%97%E6%A0%BC%E5%A6%AE%E8%BE%BE\" title=\"角色图鉴库/罗格妮达\"><img alt=\"头像 罗格妮达.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/b3/c4fwdlbtqsacncted6tng2xslvprr4g.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">罗格妮达</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022095227\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.416 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.597 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 9680/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 157702/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11210/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  577.422      1 模板:简单技能\n100.00%  577.422      1 -total\n  9.23%   53.316      1 模板:中括号介绍化\n  8.44%   48.711      5 模板:中括号介绍\n  2.00%   11.521      1 模板:面包屑\n  1.08%    6.234      1 模板:列表/头像\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:7998-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022095227 and revision id 19240. Serialized with PHP.\n